  "solution_ref": "$m=2,3,5,6,7$: $n\\mid12$, $n\\ge2$ → $2,3,4,6,12$로 5개. $m=4$: $x^n=2^{24}$ → 7개. $m=8$: $2^{36}$ → 8개. $m=9$: $3^{24}$ → 7개. 합 $5\\cdot5+7\\cdot2+8=47$",
